                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Oral Suspension</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Pain Reliever-Fever Reducer</paragraph>
                  <paragraph/>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">Pain+Fever</content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Infants</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">DYE-FREE</content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph/>
                  <paragraph/>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">Free Of:</content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph/>
                  <paragraph>• Dyes
  <br/>
• Alcohol
  <br/>
• Ibuprofen
  <br/>
• Aspirin
